---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — How Rich Is Too Rich"
  description="Why we built How Rich Is Too Rich, a free satirical billionaire net-worth spending game."
  path="/about"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink">About How Rich Is Too Rich</h1>
    <p class="mt-6">
      How Rich Is Too Rich is a small independent web project built by a solo developer who got
      curious what it would actually feel like to spend a fortune the size of the world's richest
      people's. Public "net worth" numbers are abstract — this site turns one into something
      tangible: a shop, a receipt, and a counter ticking toward zero.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      The site is free to play, requires no account, and runs entirely in your browser — nothing
      you click is ever sent to a server. It's supported by display advertising, which is what
      keeps it free and ad-account-review-friendly rather than paywalled.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Net worth figures used in the game are illustrative public estimates (see each page's cited
      source and date), not real-time financial data, and the game is not affiliated with,
      endorsed by, or sponsored by anyone it features. Read the full
      <a href="/disclaimer" class="underline hover:text-pop-pink">disclaimer</a> for details.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Questions, feedback, or a takedown request? Visit the
      <a href="/contact" class="underline hover:text-pop-pink">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>